{
  "id": "self_monitoring",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "depends_on": [
    "experimentation_core"
  ],
  "description": "The agent's surprise->investigation self-monitoring as graph data: the 3-rule cascade (construct the per-firing investigation subroutine + its windowed event-recall query; execute the query into causes_set; pick the top cause by nested Argmax over salience). Auto-captured from the agent's own make_rule-built graph-native Rules (no Python callback -- _do_surprise_investigation was deleted). Depends on experimentation_core for the wonder_why_query recall.",
